# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for `vite dev`. NAMES ONLY, NEVER VALUES.
#
# There is exactly one variable, and there used to be two. VITE_SUPABASE_URL is
# gone since R-2026-09-22-57: the database origin is tracked configuration in
# packages/origins, chosen at runtime from the host, so it is no longer something a
# build can be missing or get wrong.
#
# THE KEY IS NOT TRACKED, and that is a decision rather than an omission. It is a
# rotatable credential with a lifecycle independent of this repository, and
# docs/runbook-key-rotation.md makes scripts/get_publishable_key.sh the one
# sanctioned way to obtain it. A tracked key would make this repository the place a
# STALE key lives -- and a dead key fails at authentication, which reads exactly
# like the boundary holding.
#
# It is published in every client bundle by design; the security model assumes an
# attacker holds it. That is why it may be absent here without anything being lost,
# and it is NOT a reason to paste it in.
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
